	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\">&nbsp;</span>Normal operation with TAY 620-15 engines: Cost Index 24 in climb, then CI 40 in cruise. Use LRC mode.</span></li>
