	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;</span></span>Flaps 15° takeoff mandatory: when a Low Level Windshear (LLWS) advisory is in effect.</span></li>
	<li style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial;\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\">&nbsp;</span></span>FLEX takeoff permitted, except when a Low Level Windshear (LLWS) advisory is in effect or when required by performance considerations (short or contaminated runway); in these cases, full TO thrust is mandatory.</span></li>
